{"id":"d6250dd7b599c526","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-pressburger.md","title":"Pressburger Arithmetic","display":"thm-pressburger — Pressburger Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pressburger","aliases":["58-thm-pressburger"],"display":"thm-pressburger — Pressburger Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[58-df-theory]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pressburger"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pressburger</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pressburger — Pressburger Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"58-df-theory\">58-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51e24c83f9ce8f44\" href=\"?note=51e24c83f9ce8f44\" title=\"../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md\">../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P}\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}=\\{0,1,+,&lt;\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}=\\{0,1,+,&lt;\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,&lt;)\">\\(T_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,&lt;)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"58-df-theory\">58-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pressburger}\\vdash\nT_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,&lt;)\n\\to&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T_{\\mathrm P},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\to(\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P}\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P})\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pressburger}\\vdash\nT_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,&lt;)\n\\to&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T_{\\mathrm P},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\to(\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P}\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P})\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Presburger arithmetic is the complete decidable first-order theory of natural-number addition with order.</li>\n<li>The undecidable contrast is full arithmetic with multiplication, not arithmetic on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> as such.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e24c83f9ce8f44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-decidable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Theory}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}=\\{0,1,+,<\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,<)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pressburger}\\vdash\nT_{\\mathrm P}=\\operatorname{Th}(\\mathbb N;0,1,+,<)\n\\to&\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T_{\\mathrm P},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P},T_{\\mathrm P})\\\\\n&\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P})\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm P}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\n\\to(\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P}\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T_{\\mathrm P})\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4366","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-pressburger.md|58-thm-pressburger]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["90ce6acf0c65af45","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","51e24c83f9ce8f44"]}